---
import SpeakerImg from "../../assets/images/about/wojtek.png"
import StageImg from "../../assets/images/about/stage.png"
import DonutImg from "../../assets/images/about/donut.png"
import AudienceImg from "../../assets/images/about/people.png"
import NetworkingImg from "../../assets/images/about/networking.png"
---

<section class="section background">
  <div class="section__inner container">
    <h2>What's in the cake?</h2>
    <p>CAKE conf is a community-powered conference, organized by the Content Bytes Foundation.</p>
    <p>We are celebrating all things content: from UX writing to AI, from documentation to storytelling, from accessibility to managing content teams. We bring together content enthusiasts from different backgrounds to share insights, spark ideas, and build a more connected content ecosystem.</p>
    <p>CAKE conf is a non-profit project, which means that all proceeds from the tickets fuel the conference experience.</p>
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile">
        <img src={SpeakerImg.src} alt="One of speakers at CAKE conf signing his book" class="img" />
        <h3>Workshops</h3>
        <p class="desc-text">Workshops give the participants the tools and mentorship to master new content skills hands on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <h3>Speakers</h3>
        <p class="desc-text">Skilled speakers are key to delivering topics that are not only deeply informative but also genuinely entertaining.</p>
        <img src={StageImg.src} alt="One of speakers at CAKE conf speaking on the stage" class="img reverse" />
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <img src={AudienceImg.src} alt="One of speakers at CAKE conf speaking on the stage" class="img" />
        <h3>Talks</h3>
        <p class="desc-text">Talk topics range from accessibility, AI, content creation and testing to content and team management.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <h3>Diverse audience</h3>
        <p class="desc-text">Perspectives from tech writing, UX design, AI, development,and content management stir up some exciting conversations.</p>
        <img src={NetworkingImg.src} alt="One of speakers at CAKE conf speaking on the stage" class="img reverse" />
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <img src={DonutImg.src} alt="One of speakers at CAKE conf speaking on the stage" class="img" />
        <h3>Networking</h3>
        <p class="desc-text">Networking is the heart of our event! Breaks mean swapping thoughts,sparking new ideas, and even kickstarting exciting projects!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .background {
    background-color: #ECECEC;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .container {
    padding-top: 100px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }

  h3 {
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tiles {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 30px;
  }
  .tile {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .desc-text {
    font-size: 14px; !important
  }

  .img {
    width: 160px;
  }

  @media only screen and (max-width: 1100px) {
    .tiles {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .reverse {
      order: -1;
    }
  }

</style>